('127.249.d.2.A',4,'Which design choice makes a business website more professional?','["Unlabeled links", "A clear layout with consistent colors and readable text", "Tiny gray fonts", "Blinking text"]'::jsonb,1,'Clarity builds credibility.','original'),
('127.249.d.2.B',3,'Setting up a virtual business office requires a computer, internet access, and:','["A forklift", "A greenhouse", "A reliable phone line or app", "A cargo truck"]'::jsonb,2,'Communication tools are essential.','original'),
