('127.249.d.3.B',3,'Choosing whether to meet clients by phone, video, or email is deciding:','["Communication methods", "Tax rates", "Office decor", "Product names"]'::jsonb,0,'Channels fit client needs.','original'),
('127.249.d.3.B',4,'A local client may prefer in-person or phone meetings, while a remote client may prefer:','["Smoke signals", "Video calls and email", "Telegrams only", "Postcards only"]'::jsonb,1,'Remote clients use digital tools.','original'),
('127.249.d.3.C',3,'A virtual office charges $30 per hour. A job takes 4 hours. The fee is:','["$7.50", "$1,200", "$120", "$34"]'::jsonb,2,'30 x 4 = 120.','original'),
('127.249.d.3.C',4,'Setting fees too low can:','["Eliminate costs", "Increase profit always", "Guarantee clients", "Hurt profit and signal poor quality"]'::jsonb,3,'Underpricing causes problems.','original'),
