('127.249.d.4.D',4,'Money customers owe to the business is called:','["Accounts payable", "Equity", "Expenses", "Accounts receivable"]'::jsonb,3,'Receivables are due from clients.','original'),
('127.249.d.4.E',3,'A statement listing assets, liabilities, and owner''s equity is a:','["Balance sheet", "Business plan", "Invoice", "Income statement"]'::jsonb,0,'The balance sheet shows financial position.','original'),
('127.249.d.4.E',4,'A statement that shows revenue minus expenses over a period is an:','["Memo", "Income statement", "Resume", "Balance sheet"]'::jsonb,1,'It shows profit or loss.','original'),
('127.249.d.5.A',3,'Before starting, an owner must find out whether the city or county requires a:','["Library card", "Hunting permit", "Business license or permit", "Parking pass"]'::jsonb,2,'Licensing varies locally.','original'),
('127.249.d.5.A',4,'To learn local licensing rules, an owner can contact:','["A random stranger", "A radio station", "A competitor only", "The city or county clerk"]'::jsonb,3,'Local offices administer licenses.','original'),
('127.249.d.5.B',3,'Setting up a home workspace with a computer, phone, and file system is:','["Setting up a virtual business office", "Shipping goods", "Auditing taxes", "Closing a business"]'::jsonb,0,'Setup creates a working office.','original'),
('127.249.d.5.B',4,'A good workspace for a virtual office is:','["Without internet", "Quiet, organized, and equipped for work", "Noisy and cluttered", "Without a desk"]'::jsonb,1,'Environment affects productivity.','original'),
('127.249.d.5.C',3,'Support resources for small businesses include:','["Gossip groups", "Casinos", "Small business development centers and SCORE mentors", "Arcades"]'::jsonb,2,'These offer free help.','original'),
('127.249.d.5.C',4,'A new owner needing free advice on writing a business plan could contact:','["A rumor mill", "A bakery", "A game store", "A Small Business Development Center"]'::jsonb,3,'SBDCs counsel entrepreneurs.','original'),
('127.249.d.5.D',3,'A business with one owner who has unlimited personal liability is a:','["Sole proprietorship", "Corporation", "Limited liability company", "Cooperative"]'::jsonb,0,'Sole proprietors are personally liable.','original'),
('127.249.d.5.D',4,'An advantage of an LLC over a sole proprietorship is:','["Unlimited liability", "Limited personal liability", "No taxes ever", "No paperwork"]'::jsonb,1,'LLCs shield personal assets.','original'),
('127.249.d.6.A',3,'A virtual business must keep records of clients, work done, and:','["Neighbors'' names", "Sports scores", "Payments received", "Weather"]'::jsonb,2,'Records support service and billing.','original'),
