('127.250.d.1.H',3,'Strategic HR planning begins by:','["Ignoring goals", "Firing staff", "Forecasting the organization''s future staffing needs", "Waiting for turnover"]'::jsonb,2,'Plans align with business goals.','original'),
('127.250.d.1.H',4,'A company plans to double in size. HR strategic planning should include:','["Cutting training", "Freezing hiring", "Closing HR", "Recruiting and training plans for new hires"]'::jsonb,3,'Growth needs staffing.','original'),
('127.250.d.2.A',3,'The Equal Pay Act requires employers to pay men and women:','["Equal pay for equal work", "Different pay", "Higher pay for men", "No pay"]'::jsonb,0,'The Equal Pay Act bans sex-based pay gaps.','original'),
